    "created_at": "2017-07-12T08:17:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-07-12T08:17:09Z",
    "body": "I agree with both @mystor and @bzbarsky that we probably shouldn't be copying `sessionStorage` over to the newly created `noopener` window. I bet we can get away with doing the same for `noreferrer`, since this is a fairly niche case.",
